{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Taking pictures?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I like taking pictures here because{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
